<table border=0 width=100% cellspacing=1 bgcolor="#6394BD" class="bordercolor">
  <tr>
    <td align=left bgcolor="#6E94B7"><font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size=2>&nbsp;7&nbsp;</font></td>
    <td width=75% bgcolor="#6E94B7"><font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size=2><b>&nbsp;Members and Friends / Adventures in Norrath / <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?board=14;action=display;num=1020667731;start=41"><font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size=2><u>n00b dAzE</u></font></a></b></font></td>
    <td align=right bgcolor="#6E94B7"><nobr>&nbsp;<font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size=2>on: Jul 21<sup>st</sup>, 2002, 11:02pm&nbsp;</font></nobr></td>
  </tr><tr>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#DEE7EF" class="catbg"><font class="catbg" size=2>Started by <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?action=viewprofile;username=Skulbasher" alt="View Profile: Skulbasher">Skulbasher</a> | Last post by <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?action=viewprofile;username=Skulbasher" alt="View Profile: Skulbasher">Skulbasher</a></font></td>
  </tr><tr height=80>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#D8F8F8" valign=top><font size=2>  &quot;I want to buy some kewl wizard stuff,&quot; Dunno said. <br> &nbsp; &quot;Listen to the auction channel,&quot; the dwarf said, &quot;and we'll see if we can find something in your price range.&quot; <br> &nbsp; Harvey auctioned “WTS dagger of marnek” <br> &nbsp; Noonhan auctioned “WTS ornate runed shield” <br> &nbsp; Ironmike auctioned “WTB STD” <br> &nbsp; Muleboy auctioned “WTS SMR, Batfang earrings, CCS” <br> &nbsp; “Any of that good wizard stuff?” Dunno asked. <br> &nbsp; “Yes,” the dwarf said.  “But you don’t have the money for that stuff.  The SMR is a nice wizard robe, but you can’t afford it yet.” <br> &nbsp; “Jeez, what can I buy then??” <br> &nbsp; “You could buy a batfang earring, but you could probably buy a bunch of other lower-level stuff for your money which would do you a lot better.” <br> &nbsp; Yorrmin auctioned “WTS everything on me, bank platform” <br> &nbsp; Hopscotch auctioned “WTS howling harpoon.” <br> &nbsp; “What’s a harpoon?” Dunno asked the dwarf. <br> &nbsp; “It’s a nice item to have, but not really for wizards.” <br> &nbsp; “Oh.” <br> &nbsp; Manopeace auctioned “WTS Frostbringer” <br> &nbsp; Olliendar auctioned “WTB Facegrinder” <br> &nbsp; Jimcricket auctioned “WTB Woodchipper” <br> &nbsp; Barbarella auctioned “WTS everything off me” <br> &nbsp; “I don’t know,” Dunno said.  “None of this stuff sounds interesting.” <br> &nbsp; “You are twelve.” <br> &nbsp; “Ok, this sucks.” <br> &nbsp; “You’ve only been listening for like ten seconds.  Give it a chance.” <br> &nbsp; “I’d rather be playing.  This is boring.” <br> &nbsp; &quot;You can't buy anything if you don't participate in the auctions.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;Don't they have a store or shopping center where I can just look directly for the stuff I want?  Without having to listen to everyone yak about their crap I don't need.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;I think that's coming out in the next patch,&quot; the dwarf said, smiling.  &quot;I believe they will have an entire city devoted to selling stuff, and there'll be a food court and a video arcade to hang out at, too.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;Right on.  Now these people are getting smart.&quot; <br> &nbsp; “Look, get a fbr, staff of writhing, stein of muggok, and a savant’s cap.  That should do you well for your budget, and it’s good low-level stuff.” <br> &nbsp; &quot;So, where can I buy those?&quot; <br> &nbsp; Jakazz auctions “WTS ARG” <br> &nbsp; Peanuthead auctions “WTS SALT” <br> &nbsp; Muleboy auctioned “WTS SMR, Batfang earrings, CCS” <br> &nbsp; The dwarf rolled his eyes.  &quot;If you want items, you will need to listen to the auctions.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;But I don't know what any of this crap is!  What is an SMR?  And a ARG?&quot; <br> &nbsp; The dwarf pursed his lips.  &quot;SMR stands for shiny metallic robes.&quot; <br> &nbsp; Dunno blinked.  &quot;Are those cool?&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;You can't afford them.  Just buy what I told you to, and you'll be fine for a long time.  You can get a SMR later.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;But I don't understand the acro-whatsits.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;RTFM ASAP and STFU.&quot; <br> &nbsp; Dunno blinked.  &quot;What does that mean?&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;Sorry, wrong hotkey.&quot; </font></td>
  </tr><tr>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#DEE7EF"><font size=2>&nbsp;
